  "Package": "OAtools",
  "Title": "Analysis of OpenArray PCR Data",
  "Version": "0.99.13",
  "Description": "Provides a suite of R functions to analyze gene expression\nexperiments on the OpenArray real-time PCR platform. OAtools\nfits logistic regressions to fluorescence curves to distinguish\nbetween real amplification and false positives. OAtools\nsupports data import, analysis, and visualization through plots\nand a dynamic HTML report.",
